2348
01:27:58,560 --> 01:28:02,320
echoes.

2349
01:28:00,159 --> 01:28:03,920
In ultrasound, acoustic waves interact

2350
01:28:02,320 --> 01:28:05,520
with different tissues in different ways

2351
01:28:03,920 --> 01:28:07,440
and that's why we see some areas

2352
01:28:05,520 --> 01:28:10,719
