01:32:02,560 --> 01:32:06,960
Moreover, these microbubbles can be

2457
01:32:04,560 --> 01:32:09,440
customized. Scientists can modify the

2458
01:32:06,960 --> 01:32:10,719
shell using polymers or special coatings

2459
01:32:09,440 --> 01:32:13,520
that allow the surface to be

2460
01:32:10,719 --> 01:32:15,679
