2461
01:32:13,520 --> 01:32:18,080
When certain antibodies are attached,

2462
01:32:15,679 --> 01:32:20,560
the microbubbles can specifically bind

2463
01:32:18,080 --> 01:32:23,760
to biological targets, for example,

2464
01:32:20,560 --> 01:32:25,679
tumor cells or inflammatory markers.

2465
01:32:23,760 --> 01:32:28,159
When that happens, the microbubbles

2466
01:32:25,679 --> 01:32:30,000
accumulate around those target regions.

2467
01:32:28,159 --> 01:32:32,080
On the ultrasound image, those regions

2468
01:32:30,000 --> 01:32:34,239
appear as bright localized signals,

2469
01:32:32,080 --> 01:32:37,120
making it possible to identify molecular

2470
01:32:34,239 --> 01:32:39,440
features, not just structural ones.

2471
01:32:37,120 --> 01:32:41,440
In other words, microbubbles transform

2472
01:32:39,440 --> 01:32:43,920
ultrasound from a purely anatomical

2473
01:32:41,440 --> 01:32:47,360
imaging modality into a molecular and

2474
01:32:43,920 --> 01:32:49,600
cellular imaging tool. So when you see

2475
01:32:47,360 --> 01:32:51,440
very bright clustered signals after

2476
01:32:49,600 --> 01:32:53,040
microbubble injection, it often

2477
01:32:51,440 --> 01:32:56,719
indicates the presence of something

2478
01:32:53,040 --> 01:32:58,400
biologically distinct such as a tumor.

2479
01:32:56,719 --> 01:33:00,400
This development marks a major

2480
01:32:58,400 --> 01:33:02,320
advancement in medical ultrasound,

2481
01:33:00,400 --> 01:33:06,360
extending it from traditional imaging

2482
01:33:02,320 --> 01:33:06,360
into targeted diagnostics.

2483
01:33:08,080 --> 01:33:12,239
Now let's move one step further using

2484
01:33:10,159 --> 01:33:14,480
microbubbles not just for imaging but

2485
01:33:12,239 --> 01:33:16,239
also for therapy.

2486
01:33:14,480 --> 01:33:18,800
This concept is known as acoustically

2487
01:33:16,239 --> 01:33:21,120
enabled drug delivery. The idea is both

2488
01:33:18,800 --> 01:33:22,960
simple and powerful. Suppose we inject a

2489
01:33:21,120 --> 01:33:24,480
drug together with microbubbles into the

2490
01:33:22,960 --> 01:33:26,400
bloodstream.

2491
01:33:24,480 --> 01:33:28,000
These microbubbles circulate throughout

2492
01:33:26,400 --> 01:33:30,800
the body including through the small

2493
01:33:28,000 --> 01:33:32,159
vessels or microvasculare around a tumor

2494
01:33:30,800 --> 01:33:34,080
site.

2495
01:33:32,159 --> 01:33:36,560
When we know the approximate location of

2496
01:33:34,080 --> 01:33:39,120
a tumor, we can focus ultrasound waves

2497
01:33:36,560 --> 01:33:41,440
precisely on that region. The ultrasound

2498
01:33:39,120 --> 01:33:43,679
energy tuned to the right amplitude and

2499
01:33:41,440 --> 01:33:46,800
frequency causes the microbubbles in

2500
01:33:43,679 --> 01:33:48,880
that area to oscillate vigorously.

2501
01:33:46,800 --> 01:33:51,040
If we increase the energy slightly, the

2502
01:33:48,880 --> 01:33:53,040
bubbles rupture or collapse, releasing

2503
01:33:51,040 --> 01:33:54,639
their drug payload right at the target

2504
01:33:53,040 --> 01:33:56,480
site.

2505
01:33:54,639 --> 01:33:58,480
This process delivers the medication

2506
01:33:56,480 --> 01:34:00,239
directly to the tumor, minimizing side

2507
01:33:58,480 --> 01:34:02,480
effects and maximizing treatment

2508
01:34:00,239 --> 01:34:04,400
effectiveness. It's like having millions

2509
01:34:02,480 --> 01:34:06,080
of tiny delivery capsules that release

2510
01:34:04,400 --> 01:34:08,880
the drug only when and where an

2511
01:34:06,080 --> 01:34:10,800
ultrasound activates them. This

2512
01:34:08,880 --> 01:34:12,639
technique opens the door to an entirely

2513
01:34:10,800 --> 01:34:15,199
new field known as theronostics,

2514
01:34:12,639 --> 01:34:17,199
combining therapy and diagnostics. With

2515
01:34:15,199 --> 01:34:18,800
this approach, ultrasound imaging can

2516
01:34:17,199 --> 01:34:20,800
both visualize and treat disease

2517
01:34:18,800 --> 01:34:22,639
simultaneously.

2518
01:34:20,800 --> 01:34:24,320
The precision and non-invasiveness of

2519
01:34:22,639 --> 01:34:26,320
this method make it an extremely

2520
01:34:24,320 --> 01:34:28,159
promising direction for the future,

2521
01:34:26,320 --> 01:34:30,800
particularly for treating cancers and

2522
01:34:28,159 --> 01:34:33,280
other localized diseases.

2523
01:34:30,800 --> 01:34:35,520
So using ultrasound and microbubbles

2524
01:34:33,280 --> 01:34:37,600
together, we can not only image internal

2525
01:34:35,520 --> 01:34:40,080
structures in great detail, but also

2526
01:34:37,600 --> 01:34:42,480
control drug delivery dynamically by

2527
01:34:40,080 --> 01:34:44,239
sound waves themselves.

2528
01:34:42,480 --> 01:34:46,159
This is an exciting frontier in

2529
01:34:44,239 --> 01:34:49,159
biomedical engineering and medical

2530
01:34:46,159 --> 01:34:49,159
imaging.

